   Canonical text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

3. File-level licensing is determined by SPDX headers, adjacent `.license`
   files, REUSE.toml, directory-specific notices, or explicit file notices.

4. Unannotated pre-existing files are not silently relicensed by this notice.
   Their historical licensing status remains subject to file-level and
   release-level review.

5. LICENSE.md explains the repository policy and the archived status of the
   former Terra Public License draft. That draft is not the active blanket
   license of this repository.

6. Standard license texts, third-party materials, quotations, logos, marks,
   linked works, and external standards retain their own rights and terms.

7. Copyright and software licenses do not grant endorsement, certification,
   partnership, or general trademark permission.

